  "goodToKnow": "Erobern means to conquer, literally and figuratively: eine Stadt erobern, den Markt erobern, ein Herz erobern. Die Eroberung is the conquest, and der Eroberer is the conqueror. It has no ge- in the participle: erobert. In everyday life, you'll hear it for a new gadget or trend that conquers the market: Das Smartphone hat die Welt erobert. A close synonym is einnehmen, used mostly for towns."
